1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,625
An image board on an infinite canvas.

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:08,475
Paste or drop references: frames, screenshots, swatches.

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:12,725
Group them into zones. A zone named Avoid holds what you don't want.

4
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:17,575
Pin the ones that matter with Focus, and leave a note for the AI.

5
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:22,225
MCP access is off until you turn it on: view only, or view and add.

6
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:26,875
A connected tool can put its attempt next to the reference it aimed for.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,900
Plain files on your machine. No account.
github.com/HesNotTheGuy/board
